---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';

const pubDate = new Date('2026-09-04');
---

<Layout
	title="Participate in My Journey & Research"
	description="Sign up to follow my personal recovery logs, weekly research breakdowns, and participate in our patient community."
	pubDate={pubDate}
>
	<div class="join-page">
		<p class="lead" style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 2rem;">
			When my BMS began, the isolation was almost as painful as the physical sensation in my mouth. I created this space so that you and I can share data, compare protocols, and navigate this condition together.
		</p>
		
		<div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); padding: 3rem 2rem; border-radius: 24px; margin: 3rem 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);">
            <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; text-align: center;">
				<span class="meta-tag" style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Free Direct Updates</span>
				<h3 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 800;">Get My Weekly Experiment Notes</h3>
				<p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1rem;">Join fellow sufferers and health practitioners following my recovery notes and survey findings.</p>
                <!-- MailerLite Form -->
                <div class="ml-embedded" data-form="0R4iAA"></div>
            </div>
		</div>

		<div style="margin-top: 4rem;">
			<h2 style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">What I Send You Each Week:</h2>
			<ul style="line-height: 1.85; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
				<li><strong>My Real-Time Experiment Logs:</strong> Complete transparency into what I am testing—supplements, diet changes, breathwork, and night taping protocols.</li>
				<li><strong>Medical Research Breakdowns:</strong> I comb through complex neuropathic and oral medicine journals and synthesize the takeaways into practical, patient-focused takeaways.</li>
				<li><strong>Survey Discoveries:</strong> Early access to our aggregated patient survey results, identifying trigger clusters and relief trends.</li>
				<li><strong>Support Call Invitations:</strong> Direct links to our monthly video meetups where patients connect and support each other face-to-face.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

        <p style="margin-top: 4rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; text-align: center;">
            🔒 I respect your privacy. Zero spam, just science, personal notes, and real community. You can unsubscribe with one click anytime.
        </p>
	</div>
</Layout>
